      "writtenOn": "2021-04-22T21:04:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean checking before the clear?  I think the ordering of calling after the clear is important for the Rp selection. \n\nMy general thinking was that pd_is_connected() represents Attached.SRC/Attached.SNK, which is the time when the domain of CC control goes to higher levels for collision avoidance.  Anytime we\u0027re not Attached.Whatever the CC lines should be purely in the domain of the TC layer",
      "parentUuid": "39f7d789_01550096",
      "revId": "a622de783225de0567a37d89da22c81b202abe5d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
